---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '@/components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '@/components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="对比工具 - 机场指南"
  description="多维度参数对比，帮助您选择最适合的机场服务。"
>
  <Header />

  <main class="py-12 lg:py-16">
    <div class="container-custom">
      <!-- 面包屑 -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600 mb-8">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-primary-600">首页</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-slate-900">对比工具</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- 页面标题 -->
      <div class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">对比工具</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-600">多维度参数对比，帮助您做出明智选择</p>
      </div>

      <!-- 对比表格 -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <div class="card overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full">
            <thead class="bg-slate-50">
              <tr>
                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-left text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 sticky left-0 bg-slate-50">对比维度</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 min-w-[200px]">示例 A</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 min-w-[200px]">示例 B</th>
                <th class="px-6 py-4 text-center text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900 min-w-[200px]">示例 C</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-slate-100">
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 sticky left-0 bg-white">线路类型</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-center text-slate-600">IEPL专线</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-center text-slate-600">BGP中转</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-center text-slate-600">CN2 GIA</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 sticky left-0 bg-white">节点数量</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">50+</span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">30+</span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">40+</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 sticky left-0 bg-white">流媒体解锁</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-green-700">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    支持
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-green-700">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    支持
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-amber-700">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.707 7.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L8.586 10l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 11.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11.414 10l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 8.586 8.707 7.293z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    部分
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 sticky left-0 bg-white">AI工具支持</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-green-700">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    支持
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-amber-700">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.707 7.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L8.586 10l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 11.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11.414 10l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 8.586 8.707 7.293z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    部分
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm text-green-700">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                      <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z" clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                    </svg>
                    支持
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 sticky left-0 bg-white">游戏加速</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-center text-slate-600">优秀</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-center text-slate-600">一般</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm text-center text-slate-600">良好</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 sticky left-0 bg-white">稳定性评分</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">9.2</span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">8.5</span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">8.8</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 sticky left-0 bg-white">性价比评分</td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">9.0</span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">9.3</span>
                </td>
                <td class="px-6 py-4 text-center">
                  <span class="text-lg font-bold text-primary-600">8.6</span>
                </td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 维度说明 -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">对比维度说明</h2>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">线路质量</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              包括线路类型、节点分布、带宽质量等因素。IEPL专线通常速度最快，CN2 GIA稳定性好，BGP中转性价比高。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">流媒体解锁</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              是否支持Netflix、Disney+、HBO等主流流媒体平台的解锁，以及解锁的稳定性和覆盖区域。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">AI工具支持</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              能否正常访问ChatGPT、Claude、Midjourney等AI工具，是否有IP限制或需要特殊配置。
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3">游戏加速</h3>
            <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              延迟表现、丢包率、抖动情况等，特别是对游戏服务器的连接质量和稳定性。
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- 选择建议 -->
      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">选择建议</h2>
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 10l4.553-2.276A1 1 0 0121 8.618v6.764a1 1 0 01-1.447.894L15 14M5 18h8a2 2 0 002-2V8a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">流媒体用户</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  如果主要用途是观看Netflix、Disney+等流媒体，建议选择流媒体解锁能力强、节点覆盖广的服务。示例A和示例B都是不错的选择。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z"></path>
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">游戏玩家</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  游戏需要低延迟和稳定连接，推荐选择专线服务。示例A的IEPL专线在游戏加速方面表现优秀，适合对延迟要求高的用户。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card p-6">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-primary-100 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-primary-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"></path>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 mb-2">预算有限用户</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                  如果更看重性价比，示例B的性价比评分最高，虽然部分功能不如专线，但日常使用完全够用，适合预算有限的用户。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- FAQ -->
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">常见问题</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="card group">
            <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">如何选择适合自己的服务？</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              首先明确自己的主要使用场景，然后根据对比表格中的各项指标进行综合评估。如果还不确定，可以先试用短期套餐。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="card group">
            <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">评分是如何计算的？</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              评分综合了速度、稳定性、功能支持、价格等多个维度，基于实际测试数据和用户反馈进行综合评估。
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="card group">
            <summary class="px-6 py-4 cursor-pointer list-none flex items-center justify-between">
              <span class="font-semibold text-slate-900">数据多久更新一次？</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-slate-500 group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
              对比数据会定期更新，通常每月进行一次全面测试和数据更新，确保信息的时效性。
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
